; FARO - creature field sprites (16x16, 8x16 mode), 8 tiles per species: frame A (idle) + frame B (move).
; Drawn facing right: flip X for left. 4 species resident at once (GDD 7.2: 32 tiles), loaded per species
; (8 tiles via the tile queue in 2 frames). Species order = species.tbl ids 1..6.
; Frame base F: left pair F, F+1; right pair F+2, F+3. <SPECIES>_A and <SPECIES>_B labels.
; 48 tiles. Generated from a script, then this file is the source of truth.

